[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592380212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2592380212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2592380212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ahJU0","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T11:08:51Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T11:09:07Z","body":"> Caches the slowest part of the AnimationTree.\n\nWell done, nicely observed! \nYour implementation makes sense to me and seems reasonable.\nHowever, i have the same concerns as @kiroxas. We definitely need to test this well to confirm it won't add any problems.\n\nWhile I'm here, I'll note that i have two open PRs that could help as a stopgap to speed up this path too:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619 to passively speed up string addition.\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99929 to actively speed it up by using string concatenation instead.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592380212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592729951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2592729951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2592729951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aietf","user":{"login":"Nazarwadim","id":116561933,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvKYDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116561933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim","html_url":"https://github.com/Nazarwadim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T12:38:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T12:38:56Z","body":"So I did better as I said by simply caching two Stringnames. The performance is the same as before.\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\nProject FPS: 70 (14.28 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 70 (14.28 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 69 (14.49 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 69 (14.49 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 71 (14.08 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 70 (14.28 mspf)\r\n\r\nCurrent PR:\r\nProject FPS: 93 (10.75 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 94 (10.63 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 96 (10.41 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 95 (10.52 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 95 (10.52 mspf)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592729951/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592749341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2592749341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2592749341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aijcd","user":{"login":"Nazarwadim","id":116561933,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvKYDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116561933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim","html_url":"https://github.com/Nazarwadim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T12:45:06Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T12:58:17Z","body":"@Ivorforce One allocation was called for combining these Strings (because there is no `realloc` on profiling), so I don't think that these PRs will help here. Also need to take into account getting `String` from `StringName`, which is slow in multithreading.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592749341/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592864841","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2592864841","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2592864841,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ai_pJ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T13:30:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T13:38:27Z","body":"> @Ivorforce One allocation was called for combining these Strings (because there is no `realloc` on profiling), so I don't think that these PRs will help here. Also need to take into account getting `String` from `StringName`, which is slow in multithreading.\r\n\r\nWell, the current code (`+ +`) necessitates 7 allocations (4 from scratch, 3 re-, + 7 copies), while the code from #100619 would bring it down to 4 (from scratch) and `String::concat` from #99929 should bring it down to just 1. \r\nGetting `String` from `StringName` is free if the `StringName` was initialized from a `String` (rather than a `char[]` literal). Not sure where you're getting the multithreading thing from, since there's no multithreading primitives involved in `StringName.operator String()`?\r\nBut alas, there's only one way to know for sure :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592864841/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592972401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2592972401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2592972401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ajZ5x","user":{"login":"Nazarwadim","id":116561933,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvKYDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116561933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim","html_url":"https://github.com/Nazarwadim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nazarwadim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T14:16:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T14:16:48Z","body":"> Not sure where you're getting the multithreading thing from, since there's no multithreading primitives involved in StringName.operator String()\r\n\r\nGodot does not yet have multithreading in the animation system.  But if multithreading appears later, very low performance in multithreading will be due to atomics in `Memory` and `RefCount` in COW.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592972401/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593237665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2593237665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2593237665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6akaqh","user":{"login":"Saul2022","id":97898580,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdXQVA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97898580?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022","html_url":"https://github.com/Saul2022","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saul2022/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T15:34:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T15:34:59Z","body":"So considering that along with the AHashmap gives 50% more performance, would it close the animation performance problem or would it need more?. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593237665/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593266513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#issuecomment-2593266513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101564","id":2593266513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6akhtR","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T15:43:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T15:43:01Z","body":"> So considering that along with the AHashmap gives 50% more performance, would it close the animation performance problem or would it need more?.\r\n\r\nWe need more! 3.6 has double the FPS, so 50% more only gets us halfway to our goal. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593266513/reactions","tot